    "First-K3 proposal equality is 66.22% at C1 and 68.16% across C2 physical rows. Depth agreement decays from 89.19/90.13% at depth1 to 69.37/71.75% at depth3.",
    "C2 hipEngine physical rows are internally identical at every one of 240 contexts; batching does not alter the proposal IDs.",
    "18 C1 and 17 C2 logical contexts are non-comparable because at least one target root differs from the fixed Laurent teacher. These are reported separately and never scored as proposal disagreement.",
    "Proposal mismatch is therefore a real low-width acceptance mechanism; target-kernel changes cannot explain it. Keep acceptance/draft-depth and target-cost mechanisms separate."
